  "notes": [
    "Carried over from the v0.1 example and completed so that it loads into progression.sql (schema version 2).",
    "Baseline: rules 1.1.1, content 1.3.1, RNG BD-PCG32-v1. content_sha256 is the content_hash of the shipped 1.3.1 content as recorded in tests/golden/replay_pin.json.",
    "Vocation, skill, item, quest, die and encounter ids, families, skill costs and Champion's numbers come from the v0.1 vocation catalog. Novice base stats come from the shipped 1.3.1 classes.json.",
    "Illustrative values, not facts about any player: display_name, origin_vocation_id, every timestamp, every revision counter, the order of the progression events and the die instance ids.",
    "The v0.1 run phase 'preparation' is mapped to the engine phase 'upgrade': battle 1 (training_04) is won and granted the drake_scale, the mandatory upgrade is not chosen yet, and training_05 is next.",
    "The v0.1 current encounter id 'vault_05' is not in the catalog's encounter pool; it is replaced by 'training_05', which has the same threat rating 5.",
    "The v0.1 example left the public vocations arcanist, shadowbinder, ranger and archmage out of the discovered list; they are visible from the start, so they are listed as discovered here.",
    "No mastery_award_event row is recorded for battle 1: Champion was already rank 8. Whether a denied award row is written for a mastered vocation is an open design question.",
    "unlock_evaluation and current_encounter are derived at read time and are not stored."
  ],
